{"id":"7a18cfff97a1d452124caf3ace182152757c46ab","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1241270","title":"我觉得大家不用太恐慌， Tibo 关闭 20X 了绝对是暂时性的，不要去买高价 20x 成品号","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"a510104561","excerpt":"OpenAI - @a510104561 - 目前就是 Pro 20x 用户是算力使用的最多的用户后期只要他算力跟上了 自然就会开放了前面买了 20x 的真的赢麻了","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/恐慌\"><li></li> 恐慌</a><a href=\"/tag/暂时性\"><li></li> 暂时性</a><a href=\"/tag/算力\"><li></li> 算力</a></P><p><span>28 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-12 02:18:57 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18074032\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/beb0/f325/298083_normal.png?m=1781164871\" alt=\"wxVIP\" data-uid=\"298083\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wxVIP\">wxVIP</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-11 11:11:22 +08:00\">20h 52m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>没见人恐慌啊，你在想什么。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18074190\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9408/846b/511164_normal.png?m=1768478211\" alt=\"enpitsulin\" data-uid=\"511164\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/enpitsulin\">enpitsulin</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-11 11:36:17 +08:00\">20h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>关闭一下而已，除了中转站谁会慌，真有 20x 需求的早都再用了。</p><p>难道真有人想“我的钱花不出去我急死了”<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/NIvxivj.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NIvxivj.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18074238\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c4b79f02704141765a5882b3d0da5dd4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yaaaaaak\" data-uid=\"105328\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yaaaaaak\">yaaaaaak</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-11 11:48:30 +08:00\">20h 14m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>没买的就没需求，如果超过一个月不让买，你猜奥特曼和用户谁更恐慌。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18074266\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4864/6e3a/112529_normal.png?m=1660878904\" alt=\"xFrye\" data-uid=\"112529\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xFrye\">xFrye</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-11 11:54:53 +08:00\">20h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>谁慌了？大概只有开中转的才会慌</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18074311\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b6e3/d4df/545030_normal.png?m=1786599922\" alt=\"bwnjnOEI\" data-uid=\"545030\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/bwnjnOEI\">bwnjnOEI</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-11 12:07:31 +08:00\">19h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我看有人说是因为 20X 的用户两极分化用的少的 5X 就合适用的多的 20X 不够用，所以据说要推出 30X 的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18074411\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/bf63/b424/314993_normal.png?m=1789150974\" alt=\"a510104561\" data-uid=\"314993\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/a510104561\">a510104561</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-11 12:40:31 +08:00\">19h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>没有虚空索敌 因为市场在恐慌 正常自己开的用户是可以自己续费的<br>抱歉是我言语不当了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18074416\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c9ac69431a4e5d2848314a7b5963025d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"dreamk\" data-uid=\"676371\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dreamk\">dreamk</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-11 12:41:47 +08:00\">19h 21m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>饥饿营销罢了，而且有什么必须要用 Astra 的理由吗？又不是他一家独大，久了人就全跑 A\\ 去了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18074479\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6c6add1d7c4f2927102203f63474b493?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jettttt\" data-uid=\"710074\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jettttt\">jettttt</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-11 13:03:36 +08:00\">18h 59m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我有个问题问下，我是找代充站代充的，后面还能继续续费 20x 吗</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18074592\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a64e/47f6/593045_normal.png?m=1783662829\" alt=\"alexluo1\" data-uid=\"593045\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/alexluo1\">alexluo1</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-11 13:27:38 +08:00\">18h 35m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>5x+2 张重置卡，暂时还够用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18074680\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/bf63/b424/314993_normal.png?m=1789150974\" alt=\"a510104561\" data-uid=\"314993\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/a510104561\">a510104561</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-11 13:42:18 +08:00\">18h 21m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/deplives\">deplives</a> 我没说我不是<br>而且代充不是黑充也不是犯法的人 没必要 YY 我 有的人还是没有 VISA 卡充值充不进的<br>我发帖就是因为这边很多人顶着高价买成品号 我觉得没必要 提醒一下而已</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18074688\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/bf63/b424/314993_normal.png?m=1789150974\" alt=\"a510104561\" data-uid=\"314993\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/a510104561\">a510104561</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-11 13:44:23 +08:00\">18h 18m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>很多写代码的佬们一个月用几个 20x 都很正常<br>20x 新订阅被砍后 这群人是会急的 我才会发帖这样说<br>对大家造成不好的情绪 我说一句对不起<br>版主觉得我这个贴有问题也可以删掉</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18075128\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/788a/7841/488388_normal.png?m=1589242690\" alt=\"qiuhang\" data-uid=\"488388\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/qiuhang\">qiuhang</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-11 14:47:14 +08:00\">17h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我看到一个说法，前段时间 gpt6 灰度推出阶段，发了大量的重置卡，有的中转站之类的会用 plus 账号升级 prox20 ，然后重置拼命蹬，这部分容易导致成本爆炸。所以先关闭 x20 等重置卡过期再开或者推出新的适配 gpt6 强度的套餐</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18075404\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/57b94f7f153f3745286c0b8db7131786?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"layxy\" data-uid=\"428568\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/layxy\">layxy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-11 15:28:23 +08:00\">16h 34m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>慌啥，要开的早开了，没开的有消息的时候也上了末班车了，开 20x 的毕竟是少数，而且 5x 渠道也没关</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"恐慌 暂时性 算力28 replies • 2026-09-12 02:18:57 +08:00 1 wxVIP 20h 52m ago 没见人恐慌啊，你在想什么。 4 enpitsulin 20h 27m ago 关闭一下而已，除了中转站谁会慌，真有 20x 需求的早都再用了。难道真有人想“我的钱花不出去我急死了” 7 yaaaaaak 20h 14m ago via iPhone 没买的就没需求，如果超过一个月不让买，你猜奥特曼和用户谁更恐慌。 8 xFrye 20h 8m ago 谁慌了？大概只有开中转的才会慌 10 bwnjnOEI 19h 55m ago 我看有人说是因为 20X 的用户两极分化用的少的 5X 就合适用的多的 20X 不够用，所以据说要推出 30X 的。 11 a510104561 OP 19h 22m ago 没有虚空索敌 因为市场在恐慌 正常自己开的用户是可以自己续费的抱歉是我言语不当了 12 dreamk 19h 21m ago 饥饿营销罢了，而且有什么必须要用 Astra 的理由吗？又不是他一家独大，久了人就全跑 A\\ 去了 13 jettttt 18h 59m ago 我有个问题问下，我是找代充站代充的，后面还能继续续费 20x 吗 15 alexluo1 PRO 18h 35m ago 5x+2 张重置卡，暂时还够用 19 a510104561 OP 18h 21m ago @deplives 我没说我不是而且代充不是黑充也不是犯法的人 没必要 YY 我 有的人还是没有 VISA 卡充值充不进的我发帖就是因为这边很多人顶着高价买成品号 我觉得没必要 提醒一下而已 21 a510104561 OP 18h 18m ago 很多写代码的佬们一个月用几个 20x 都很正常20x 新订阅被砍后 这群人是会急的 我才会发帖这样说对大家造成不好的情绪 我说一句对不起版主觉得我这个贴有问题也可以删掉 22 qiuhang 17h 16m ago 我看到一个说法，前段时间 gpt6 灰度推出阶段，发了大量的重置卡，有的中转站之类的会用 plus 账号升级 prox20 ，然后重置拼命蹬，这部分容易导致成本爆炸。所以先关闭 x20 等重置卡过期再开或者推出新的适配 gpt6 强度的套餐 24 layxy 16h 34m ago 慌啥，要开的早开了，没开的有消息的时候也上了末班车了，开 20x 的毕竟是少数，而且 5x 渠道也没关","fetched_at":"2026-09-12T00:03:21.931Z","ok":true}